    r("Defaults and vars precedence confuse avvadam, absolute paths hardcode cheyyadam, missing dependencies, and oversized roles common mistakes.", "Common mistakes include misunderstanding variable precedence, hardcoding environment-specific paths, omitting dependencies, and creating roles that handle too many unrelated responsibilities."),
